  "snippet": "🚀 Frontend Focus #​765 — November 4, 2026 | Read on the web Safari Introduces Adaptive Dark Mode — A new (opt-in) feature added to the Safari 27.3 beta that automatically adapts light sites to dark ones. It's here becaus...",
